# Map every historical commit author/email to the canonical Soportic
# Development identity used going forward. GitHub respects this file on
# the Insights → Contributors page and `git shortlog --summary` /
# `git log` rewrite the displayed author on the fly — the actual commit
# metadata is left untouched, so no SHAs change and no force-push is
# needed.
#
# Format:  Proper Name <proper@email>  Commit Name <commit@email>

